    ('epfo-apfc-2016-q12', 12, 2016, 'January', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.reading_comprehension_sentence_correction_verbal_ability.verbal_ability_sentence_rearrangement', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance', 'General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'A branch of scholarship that flourished in Europe, particularly from the fifteenth to the eighteenth centuries, and was devoted to the appreciation, chronicling and classification of historic and non-organic relics, monuments and old texts refers to', 'यूरोप में, विशेषकर पंद्रहवीं से अठारहवीं शताब्दी तक, ऐतिहासिक और अजैव अवशेषों, स्मारकों तथा पुराने ग्रंथों के मूल्यांकन, विवरण और वर्गीकरण को समर्पित विद्या की शाखा क्या कहलाती है?', 'Archaeology', 'History', 'Architecture', 'Antiquarianism', 'पुरातत्व', 'इतिहास', 'वास्तुकला', 'पुरावस्तुवाद', 'd', 'Correct Answer: (d) Antiquarianism

Explanation: Antiquarianism centred on collecting, documenting and classifying antiquities and old texts, particularly in early modern Europe.

Archaeology systematically studies material remains; history interprets the past more broadly; architecture concerns buildings and their design. The described collecting tradition is antiquarianism.

Answer-key comparison: The independent answer matches the externally hosted UPSC-attributed Series A key.', 'सही उत्तर: (d) पुरावस्तुवाद

व्याख्या: पुरावस्तुवाद में प्राचीन वस्तुओं और ग्रंथों का संग्रह, दस्तावेजीकरण तथा वर्गीकरण किया जाता था। प्रारंभिक आधुनिक यूरोप में यह विशेष रूप से विकसित हुआ।

पुरातत्व भौतिक अवशेषों का व्यवस्थित अध्ययन है। इतिहास अतीत की व्यापक व्याख्या करता है और वास्तुकला भवनों के निर्माण तथा रूप से संबंधित है। वर्णित संग्रह-परंपरा पुरावस्तुवाद है।

उत्तर-कुंजी तुलना: स्वतंत्र उत्तर बाहरी स्रोत पर उपलब्ध UPSC के नाम से प्रकाशित श्रृंखला A की कुंजी से मेल खाता है।', NULL),
    ('epfo-apfc-2016-q13', 13, 2016, 'January', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.reading_comprehension_sentence_correction_verbal_ability.verbal_ability_sentence_rearrangement', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'hard', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance', 'General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Which statements are correct in respect of ''Stridhana''?
