    ('epfo-apfc-2016-q56', 56, 2016, 'January', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'indian_polity_constitution_governance.parliament_state_legislatures.structure_composition', 'Indian Polity, Constitution & Governance', 'भारतीय राजव्यवस्था, संविधान एवं शासन', 'Parliament & State Legislatures', 'Parliament & State Legislatures', 'Structure & Composition (Lok Sabha, Rajya Sabha, Vidhan Sabha, Vidhan Parishad; Qualification & Disqualification - Article 102, Representation of the People Act 1951, Anti-Defection Law / 10th Schedule)', 'Structure & Composition (Lok Sabha, Rajya Sabha, Vidhan Sabha, Vidhan Parishad; Qualification & Disqualification - Article 102, Representation of the People Act 1951, Anti-Defection Law / 10th Schedule)', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Which industries were first established during British rule in India?', 'ब्रिटिश शासन में भारत में सबसे पहले कौन-से उद्योग स्थापित हुए?', 'Cotton Textile and Jute', 'Jute and Iron and Steel', 'Cotton Textile and Chemical', 'Jute and Chemical', 'सूती वस्त्र और जूट', 'जूट और लोहा-इस्पात', 'सूती वस्त्र और रसायन', 'जूट और रसायन', 'a', 'Correct Answer: (a) Cotton Textile and Jute

