Statements 1 and 3 fit its constitutional role. Scheme evaluation and Five Year Plan preparation are not its defining responsibilities.

Answer-key comparison: The independent answer matches the externally hosted UPSC-attributed Series A key.', 'सही उत्तर: (b) केवल 1 और 3

