    ('epfo-apfc-2016-q90', 90, 2016, 'January', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'indian_polity_constitution_governance.parliament_state_legislatures.structure_composition', 'Indian Polity, Constitution & Governance', 'भारतीय राजव्यवस्था, संविधान एवं शासन', 'Parliament & State Legislatures', 'Parliament & State Legislatures', 'Structure & Composition (Lok Sabha, Rajya Sabha, Vidhan Sabha, Vidhan Parishad; Qualification & Disqualification - Article 102, Representation of the People Act 1951, Anti-Defection Law / 10th Schedule)', 'Structure & Composition (Lok Sabha, Rajya Sabha, Vidhan Sabha, Vidhan Parishad; Qualification & Disqualification - Article 102, Representation of the People Act 1951, Anti-Defection Law / 10th Schedule)', 'easy', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Six chess players each play every other player exactly once. How many matches are played?', 'छह शतरंज खिलाड़ी प्रत्येक दूसरे खिलाड़ी से एक बार खेलते हैं। कुल कितने मैच होंगे?', '10', '15', '20', '25', '10', '15', '20', '25', 'b', 'Correct Answer: (b) 15

Explanation: Each match corresponds to one unordered pair: C(6,2)=6×5/2=15.

Multiplying 6×5 alone double-counts each match. The other listed totals do not equal the number of pairs.

Answer-key comparison: The independent answer matches the externally hosted UPSC-attributed Series A key.', 'सही उत्तर: (b) 15

व्याख्या: प्रत्येक मैच एक अव्यवस्थित युग्म है। C(6,2)=6×5/2=15 ।

केवल 6×5 करने पर हर मैच दो बार गिना जाता है। अन्य योग युग्मों की संख्या नहीं देते।

