    ('epfo-apfc-2016-q91', 91, 2016, 'January', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'social_security_in_india.statutory_social_security_framework.maternity_benefit_act_1961', 'Social Security in India', 'भारत में सामाजिक सुरक्षा', 'Statutory Social Security Schemes & Acts', 'Statutory Social Security Schemes & Acts', 'The Maternity Benefit Act, 1961 & 2017 Amendment', 'The Maternity Benefit Act, 1961 & 2017 Amendment', 'medium', ARRAY['Maternity Benefit Act', 'Women Welfare']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'The Maternity Benefit Act, 1961 provided how many weeks’ wages during maternity?', 'मातृत्व लाभ अधिनियम, 1961 में मातृत्व अवधि के दौरान कितने सप्ताह की मजदूरी का प्रावधान था?', '11 weeks', '12 weeks', '13 weeks', '14 weeks', '11 सप्ताह', '12 सप्ताह', '13 सप्ताह', '14 सप्ताह', 'b', 'Correct Answer: (b) 12 weeks

