    ('epfo-eoao-2017-q12', 12, 2017, 'February', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.reading_comprehension_sentence_correction_verbal_ability.verbal_ability_sentence_rearrangement', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'easy', ARRAY['General English', 'Grammar', 'Vocabulary', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions: Part A (questions 1–20) is on English language and is provided in English only.', 'Directions: Part A (questions 1–20) is on English language and is provided in English only.', 'Which one of the following is the appropriate question tag in the sentence, “Take a seat, ___”?', 'Which one of the following is the appropriate question tag in the sentence, “Take a seat, ___”?', 'shall you?', 'can’t you?', 'won’t you?', 'would you?', 'shall you?', 'can’t you?', 'won’t you?', 'would you?', 'c', 'Correct Answer: (c) won’t you?

Explanation: An inviting imperative such as “Take a seat” conventionally takes “won’t you?” as its polite tag.

Shall you and can’t you do not give the intended polite invitation. Would you is possible in requests but won’t you is the conventional invitation tag here.

Answer-key comparison: The independent answer matches the externally hosted UPSC-attributed Series A key.', 'सही उत्तर: (c) won’t you?

व्याख्या: “Take a seat” जैसे आमंत्रणात्मक आदेश के साथ विनम्र question tag “won’t you?” होता है।

Shall you और can’t you उपयुक्त आमंत्रण नहीं देते। Would you अनुरोध में संभव है, पर यहाँ प्रचलित आमंत्रणात्मक tag won’t you है।

