    ('epfo-eoao-2017-q61', 61, 2017, 'February', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'insurance.principles_and_fundamentals_of_insurance.fundamental_legal_principles_of_insurance', 'Insurance', 'बीमा', 'Principles & Fundamentals of Insurance', 'Principles & Fundamentals of Insurance', 'Fundamental Legal Principles of Insurance', 'Fundamental Legal Principles of Insurance', 'medium', ARRAY['Final Accounts', 'Profit & Loss', 'Balance Sheet', 'Insurance Principles', 'Insurable Interest', 'Indemnity & Subrogation']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'From the information given below, calculate the sum insurable : Date of fire—01.03.2016 Turnover from 01.03.2015 to 29.02.2016—₹ 88,00,000 Agreed GP ratio—20% Special circumstances clause provided for the increase of turnover by 10%', 'बीमायोग्य राशि ज्ञात कीजिए:
