    ('epfo-eoao-2017-q62', 62, 2017, 'February', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'general_accounting_principles.accounting_process_and_books.double_entry_system_and_journal', 'General Accounting Principles', 'सामान्य लेखा सिद्धांत', 'Accounting Process, Books of Accounts & Trial Balance', 'Accounting Process, Books of Accounts & Trial Balance', 'Double Entry System & Recording Transactions (Journal)', 'Double Entry System & Recording Transactions (Journal)', 'medium', ARRAY['Double Entry System', 'Journal Entries', 'Golden Rules']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Income and Expenditure Account is', 'आय और व्यय खाता किस प्रकार का खाता है?', 'Real Account', 'Personal Account', 'Nominal Account', 'Capital Account', 'वास्तविक खाता', 'व्यक्तिगत खाता', 'नाममात्र खाता', 'पूँजी खाता', 'c', 'Correct Answer: (c) Nominal Account

Explanation: It records incomes and expenses and determines surplus or deficit, making it a nominal account.

Real accounts concern assets, personal accounts persons/entities, and capital accounts owner’s equity.

Answer-key comparison: The independent answer matches the externally hosted UPSC-attributed Series A key.', 'सही उत्तर: (c) नाममात्र खाता

