    ('epfo-eoao-2017-q108', 108, 2017, 'February', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'general_mental_ability_quantitative_aptitude_comprehension.quantitative_aptitude_basic_numeracy.percentages_averages_ratio-proportion.percentages_successive_change', 'General Mental Ability, Quantitative Aptitude & Comprehension', 'सामान्य मानसिक योग्यता, मात्रात्मक अभिरुचि एवं बोधगम्यता', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance', 'Quantitative Aptitude', 'General Mental Ability', 'Arithmetic']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'A cricket bat is purchased at 20% discount. If the selling price of the bat is ₹ 1,000, what was the original price of the bat?', '20% छूट पर खरीदे गए क्रिकेट बैट का विक्रय मूल्य ₹1,000 है। मूल मूल्य कितना था?', '₹1,100', '₹1,200', '₹1,225', '₹1,250', '₹1,100', '₹1,200', '₹1,225', '₹1,250', 'd', 'Correct Answer: (d) ₹1,250

Explanation: The paid price is 80% of the original. Original = 1000/0.8 = 1250.

