    ('epfo-apfc-2002-q75', 75, 2002, NULL, 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'applied_statistics.data_collection_and_central_tendency.collection_and_presentation_of_data', 'Applied Statistics', 'अनुप्रयुक्त सांख्यिकी', 'Data Collection, Presentation & Measures of Central Tendency', 'Data Collection, Presentation & Measures of Central Tendency', 'Collection, Classification & Tabulation of Data', 'Collection, Classification & Tabulation of Data', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Economy', 'General Studies', 'EPFO Verified PYQ']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Crop Yield Formulation Unit developing statistical crop-yield forecasts works under', 'फसल-उपज के सांख्यिकीय पूर्वानुमान वाली इकाई किसके अधीन है?', 'Ministry of Water Resources', 'Department of Agriculture and Cooperation', 'India Meteorological Department', 'Department of Food and Public Distribution', 'जल संसाधन मंत्रालय', 'कृषि एवं सहकारिता विभाग', 'भारत मौसम विज्ञान विभाग', 'खाद्य एवं सार्वजनिक वितरण विभाग', 'c', 'Correct Answer: (c) India Meteorological Department

Explanation: IMD’s crop-yield formulation unit developed correlation/regression forecasts. Its annual report describes that work: https://metnet.imd.gov.in/docs/imdnews/ANNUAL_REPORT2008English.pdf

