व्याख्या: मानव यकृत और पेशियों में कार्बोहाइड्रेट मुख्यतः ग्लाइकोजन के रूप में रखते हैं।

ग्लूकोज तुरंत उपलब्ध ईंधन है; स्टार्च पादप भंडारण बहुलक। शर्करा विशिष्ट संग्रह रूप का व्यापक अस्पष्ट नाम है।', NULL),
    ('epfo-apfc-2002-q91', 91, 2002, NULL, 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'science_technology_defence.information_communication_technology_ai_cyber_security.high-performance_quantum_computing', 'Science, Technology & Defence', 'विज्ञान, प्रौद्योगिकी एवं रक्षा', 'Information & Communication Technology (ICT), AI & Cyber Security', 'Information & Communication Technology (ICT), AI & Cyber Security', 'High-Performance & Quantum Computing (High-Performance Computing - Supercomputing Architecture, National Supercomputing Mission, PARAM Siddhi, Pratyush, Mihir; Quantum Information Science - Qubits, Quantum Entanglement, Superposition, National Quantum Mission; Semiconductor Ecosystem - Microprocessors - Shakti & Vega, Wafer Fabrication, India Semiconductor Mission / ISM)', 'High-Performance & Quantum Computing (High-Performance Computing - Supercomputing Architecture, National Supercomputing Mission, PARAM Siddhi, Pratyush, Mihir; Quantum Information Science - Qubits, Quantum Entanglement, Superposition, National Quantum Mission; Semiconductor Ecosystem - Microprocessors - Shakti & Vega, Wafer Fabrication, India Semiconductor Mission / ISM)', 'medium', ARRAY['Computer Applications', 'Hardware & Software', 'IT Basics', 'EPFO Verified PYQ']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Consider computer statements:
