    ('epfo-apfc-2002-q96', 96, 2002, NULL, 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'history.medieval_india', 'History', 'इतिहास', 'Medieval India', 'Medieval India', 'Medieval India', 'Medieval India', 'medium', ARRAY['General Studies', 'EPFO', 'Ancient History', 'Indian History', 'Nalanda', 'EPFO Verified PYQ']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'The foreign traveller who visited India during the Vijayanagar period was', 'विजयनगर काल में आने वाला विदेशी यात्री कौन था?', 'Megasthenes', 'Yuan Chwang', 'Fa-hien', 'Nicolo Conti', 'मेगस्थनीज', 'ह्वेनसांग', 'फाह्यान', 'निकोलो कोंटी', 'd', 'Correct Answer: (d) Nicolo Conti

Explanation: Nicolo Conti visited Vijayanagar in the early fifteenth century.

Megasthenes belongs to the Mauryan period, Fa-hien to the Gupta period, and Xuanzang to Harsha’s time.', 'सही उत्तर: (d) निकोलो कोंटी

