    ('epfo-apfc-2002-q97', 97, 2002, NULL, 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'industrial_relations_and_labour_laws.industrial_relations.theories_and_approaches_of_industrial_relations', 'Industrial Relations & Labour Laws', 'औद्योगिक संबंध एवं श्रम कानून', 'Industrial Relations & Trade Unionism', 'Industrial Relations & Trade Unionism', 'Theories and Approaches of Industrial Relations', 'Theories and Approaches of Industrial Relations', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian History', 'General Studies', 'EPFO Verified PYQ']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 97–104: Each item contains an Assertion(A) and Reason(R). Determine their truth and whether R correctly explains A; select the code in the options.', 'प्रश्न 97–104 के निर्देश: प्रत्येक में अभिकथन A और कारण R हैं। उनकी सत्यता और R द्वारा A की व्याख्या जाँचकर विकल्प का कूट चुनिए।', 'A: Among cost leadership, differentiation and market segmentation strategies, a differentiated company has less competition from direct rivals and substitutes.
