Explanation: The passage directly connects high heat capacity with oceans storing heat and moderating extremes.

Water quantity alone is not the named property; high technology is not claimed; solvent action concerns minerals, not heat moderation.', 'सही उत्तर: (b) The heat capacity of water is very high

