Explanation: Alexandria is Egyptian; Blackpool British; Constantinople is the historical name of Istanbul in Turkey; Florence is Italian. Code 5, 2, 1, 3.

The other codes (a, c, d) fail one or more of the required matches described above.', 'सही उत्तर: (b) 5, 2, 1, 3

