    ('epfo-apfc-2004-q106', 106, 2004, NULL, 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'history.ancient_india.post-gupta_period_harshavardhana', 'History', 'इतिहास', 'Ancient India', 'Ancient India', 'Post-Gupta Period & Harshavardhana', 'Post-Gupta Period & Harshavardhana', 'medium', ARRAY['General Studies', 'EPFO', 'Ancient History', 'Indian History', 'Nalanda', 'Medieval History']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Who defended Chitor Fort for four months when Akbar besieged it?', 'अकबर की घेराबंदी में चित्तौड़ की चार महीने रक्षा किसने की?', 'Uday Singh', 'Rana Pratap', 'Bhama Shah', 'Jaimal', 'उदय सिंह', 'राणा प्रताप', 'भामाशाह', 'जयमल', 'd', 'Correct Answer: (d) Jaimal

Explanation: Jaimal Rathore, with Patta, led the defence during Akbar’s 1567–68 siege after Udai Singh withdrew.

