    ('epfo-apfc-2012-q22', 22, 2012, 'September', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'international_relations_global_institutions.regional_multilateral_groupings', 'International Relations & Global Institutions', 'अंतर्राष्ट्रीय संबंध एवं वैश्विक संस्थाएं', 'Regional & Multilateral Groupings', 'Regional & Multilateral Groupings', 'Regional & Multilateral Groupings', 'Regional & Multilateral Groupings', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance', 'EPFO Verified PYQ']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Who won the UEFA Euro 2012 Golden Boot?', 'यूएफा यूरो 2012 गोल्डन बूट किसने जीता?', 'Fernando Torres (Spain)', 'Mario Balotelli (Italy)', 'Cristiano Ronaldo (Portugal)', 'Mario Gomez (Germany)', 'फर्नांडो टोरेस (स्पेन)', 'मारियो बालोटेली (इटली)', 'क्रिस्टियानो रोनाल्डो (पुर्तगाल)', 'मारियो गोमेज (जर्मनी)', 'a', 'Correct Answer: (a) Fernando Torres (Spain)

Explanation: Torres won the Golden Boot on the tournament tie-break rules after scoring three goals and providing an assist in fewer minutes.

The other three also scored three goals, but did not win the award under the assists/minutes tie-break.

Answer-key comparison: Independent answer matches the externally hosted UPSC-attributed Series D key.', 'सही उत्तर: (a) फर्नांडो टोरेस (स्पेन)

