    ('epfo-apfc-2012-q56', 56, 2012, 'September', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'indian_polity_constitution_governance.union_executive_state_executive.union_executive', 'Indian Polity, Constitution & Governance', 'भारतीय राजव्यवस्था, संविधान एवं शासन', 'Union Executive & State Executive', 'Union Executive & State Executive', 'Union Executive (President - Election, Impeachment, Powers - Executive, Legislative, Financial, Judicial, Veto, Ordinance, Pardoning 72; Vice-President; Prime Minister & Council of Ministers - Collective Responsibility, Cabinet Committees)', 'Union Executive (President - Election, Impeachment, Powers - Executive, Legislative, Financial, Judicial, Veto, Ordinance, Pardoning 72; Vice-President; Prime Minister & Council of Ministers - Collective Responsibility, Cabinet Committees)', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance', 'EPFO Verified PYQ']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'The President’s electoral college consists of elected members of:
