    ('epfo-apfc-2012-q87', 87, 2012, 'September', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.english_vocabulary_idioms_phrasal_verbs.lexical_building_blocks', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance', 'General English', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Which is closest in meaning to CIRCUITOUS?', 'Which is closest in meaning to CIRCUITOUS?', 'Indirect', 'Confusing', 'Crooked', 'Cyclic', 'Indirect', 'Confusing', 'Crooked', 'Cyclic', 'a', 'Correct Answer: (a) Indirect

