    ('epfo-apfc-2012-q100', 100, 2012, 'September', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'indian_economy_development.planning_mobilisation_of_resources_inclusive_growth', 'Indian Economy & Development', 'भारतीय अर्थव्यवस्था एवं विकास', 'Planning, Mobilisation of Resources & Inclusive Growth', 'Planning, Mobilisation of Resources & Inclusive Growth', 'Planning, Mobilisation of Resources & Inclusive Growth', 'Planning, Mobilisation of Resources & Inclusive Growth', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution of India', 'Governance', 'EPFO Verified PYQ']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'How does NRLM improve rural poor people’s livelihoods?
