    ('epfo-eoao-2021-q4', 4, 2021, 'September', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.reading_comprehension_sentence_correction_verbal_ability.verbal_ability_sentence_rearrangement', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'medium', ARRAY['General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 1–5: Select the word or group of words most appropriate to fill the blank.', 'Directions for questions 1–5: Select the word or group of words most appropriate to fill the blank.', 'With his back to the old man, he stood at the window, fists clenched, and his shoulders _____ with his choked sobbing.', 'With his back to the old man, he stood at the window, fists clenched, and his shoulders _____ with his choked sobbing.', 'shivered', 'shook', 'vibrated', 'moved', 'shivered', 'shook', 'vibrated', 'moved', 'b', 'Correct Answer: (b) shook

