    ('epfo-eoao-2021-q5', 5, 2021, 'September', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.reading_comprehension_sentence_correction_verbal_ability.verbal_ability_sentence_rearrangement', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'medium', ARRAY['General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 1–5: Select the word or group of words most appropriate to fill the blank.', 'Directions for questions 1–5: Select the word or group of words most appropriate to fill the blank.', 'The bereaved mother proudly received the gallantry award _____ her brave son who had laid down his life in the recent war.', 'The bereaved mother proudly received the gallantry award _____ her brave son who had laid down his life in the recent war.', 'in the name of', 'in lieu of', 'on behalf of', 'for the sake of', 'in the name of', 'in lieu of', 'on behalf of', 'for the sake of', 'c', 'Correct Answer: (c) on behalf of

Explanation: The mother received the award as her deceased son’s representative: on behalf of him.

In lieu of means instead of; for the sake of expresses benefit or purpose; in the name of is less precise for receiving another person’s award.', 'सही उत्तर: (c) on behalf of

व्याख्या: माँ ने दिवंगत पुत्र की प्रतिनिधि के रूप में पुरस्कार लिया; इसलिए on behalf of सही है।

In lieu of के बदले में और for the sake of हित या उद्देश्य बताता है; किसी का पुरस्कार प्रतिनिधि बनकर लेने के लिए on behalf of सटीक है।', NULL),
    ('epfo-eoao-2021-q6', 6, 2021, 'September', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.english_vocabulary_idioms_phrasal_verbs.lexical_building_blocks', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'medium', ARRAY['General English', 'Grammar', 'Vocabulary', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 6–10: Select the option opposite in meaning to the underlined word.', 'Directions for questions 6–10: Select the option opposite in meaning to the underlined word.', 'She always organises LAVISH parties on birthdays.', 'She always organises LAVISH parties on birthdays.', 'frugal', 'decent', 'cheap', 'strange', 'frugal', 'decent', 'cheap', 'strange', 'a', 'Correct Answer: (a) frugal

Explanation: Lavish means extravagant; frugal means economical and restrained.

