    ('epfo-eoao-2023-q8', 8, 2023, 'July', 1, 'eoao', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.reading_comprehension_sentence_correction_verbal_ability.sentence_correction_spotting_errors', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Sentence Correction & Spotting Errors (Common Grammatical Errors - Dangling Modifiers, Redundancies, Misplaced Prepositions, Faulty Parallelism, Tense Inconsistencies, Double Negatives)', 'Sentence Correction & Spotting Errors (Common Grammatical Errors - Dangling Modifiers, Redundancies, Misplaced Prepositions, Faulty Parallelism, Tense Inconsistencies, Double Negatives)', 'medium', ARRAY['General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 6–10: Identify the erroneous part (a), (b) or (c). Choose (d) if there is no error.', 'Directions for questions 6–10: Identify the erroneous part (a), (b) or (c). Choose (d) if there is no error.', 'The group of students on a visit to Srinagar circumnavigated around the Dal Lake.', 'The group of students on a visit to Srinagar circumnavigated around the Dal Lake.', 'The group of students', 'on a visit to Srinagar', 'circumnavigated around the Dal Lake', 'No error', 'The group of students', 'on a visit to Srinagar', 'circumnavigated around the Dal Lake', 'No error', 'c', 'Correct Answer: (c) circumnavigated around the Dal Lake

