    ('epfo-apfc-2023-q8', 8, 2023, 'July', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.english_vocabulary_idioms_phrasal_verbs.lexical_building_blocks', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'medium', ARRAY['General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 6–10: Choose the option closest in meaning to the emphasized word.', 'Directions for questions 6–10: Choose the option closest in meaning to the emphasized word.', 'The hundred-year-old college building was now in a DERELICT state.', 'The hundred-year-old college building was now in a DERELICT state.', 'Preserved for historical value', 'Unsafe for occupation', 'Neglected and broken down', 'Retaining its original beauty', 'Preserved for historical value', 'Unsafe for occupation', 'Neglected and broken down', 'Retaining its original beauty', 'c', 'Correct Answer: (c) Neglected and broken down

