    ('epfo-apfc-2023-q50', 50, 2023, 'July', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'science_technology_defence.information_communication_technology_ai_cyber_security.high-performance_quantum_computing', 'Science, Technology & Defence', 'विज्ञान, प्रौद्योगिकी एवं रक्षा', 'Information & Communication Technology (ICT), AI & Cyber Security', 'Information & Communication Technology (ICT), AI & Cyber Security', 'High-Performance & Quantum Computing (High-Performance Computing - Supercomputing Architecture, National Supercomputing Mission, PARAM Siddhi, Pratyush, Mihir; Quantum Information Science - Qubits, Quantum Entanglement, Superposition, National Quantum Mission; Semiconductor Ecosystem - Microprocessors - Shakti & Vega, Wafer Fabrication, India Semiconductor Mission / ISM)', 'High-Performance & Quantum Computing (High-Performance Computing - Supercomputing Architecture, National Supercomputing Mission, PARAM Siddhi, Pratyush, Mihir; Quantum Information Science - Qubits, Quantum Entanglement, Superposition, National Quantum Mission; Semiconductor Ecosystem - Microprocessors - Shakti & Vega, Wafer Fabrication, India Semiconductor Mission / ISM)', 'medium', ARRAY['General Studies', 'EPFO', 'Computer Applications', 'Hardware & Software', 'IT Basics']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Convert hexadecimal 5A6D to decimal.', 'हेक्साडेसिमल 5A6D को दशमलव में बदलें।', '23149', '23148', '23147', '13149', '23149', '23148', '23147', '13149', 'a', 'Correct Answer: (a) 23149

