    ('epfo-apfc-2023-q93', 93, 2023, 'July', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'indian_economy_development.macroeconomic_fundamentals_national_income_accounting', 'Indian Economy & Development', 'भारतीय अर्थव्यवस्था एवं विकास', 'Macroeconomic Fundamentals & National Income Accounting', 'Macroeconomic Fundamentals & National Income Accounting', 'Macroeconomic Fundamentals & National Income Accounting', 'Macroeconomic Fundamentals & National Income Accounting', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Economy', 'General Studies', 'Development']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'What is eSanjeevani’s primary objective?', 'ई-संजीवनी का प्रमुख उद्देश्य क्या है?', 'COVID-19 patient database', 'Telemedicine', 'Electronic National Clinical Registry', 'Health-advisory promotion', 'कोविड रोगी डेटाबेस', 'टेलीमेडिसिन', 'इलेक्ट्रॉनिक राष्ट्रीय क्लिनिकल रजिस्ट्री', 'स्वास्थ्य परामर्श प्रचार', 'b', 'Correct Answer: (b) Telemedicine

