2018: आय 115,92,82,75; लाभ 23.1,7.5,10.5,10.1।
2019: आय 125,90,85,80; लाभ 20.7,5.5,12,12.5।
2020: आय 130,96,89,95; लाभ 25.8,9.5,14,20.5।', 'How many companies’ earnings rose by at least 20% from 2016 to 2020?', '2016 से 2020 में कितनी कंपनियों की आय कम-से-कम 20% बढ़ी?', '1', '2', '3', '4', '1', '2', '3', '4', 'c', 'Correct Answer: (c) 3

Explanation: X rises 30%; Y 1/95≈1.05%; Z 15/74≈20.27%; W 90%. Thus X, Z and W qualify.

Only Y falls below the threshold; three companies, not all four or a smaller number, meet it.', 'सही उत्तर: (c) 3

व्याख्या: X 30%, Y 1/95≈1.05%, Z 15/74≈20.27% और W 90% बढ़ते हैं। X, Z और W योग्य हैं।

केवल Y सीमा से नीचे; तीन, न चार या कम, पूरे करते हैं।', NULL),
    ('epfo-apfc-2023-q105', 105, 2023, 'July', 1, 'apfc', 'UPSC EPFO APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'general_mental_ability_quantitative_aptitude_comprehension.quantitative_aptitude_basic_numeracy.percentages_averages_ratio-proportion.percentages_successive_change', 'General Mental Ability, Quantitative Aptitude & Comprehension', 'सामान्य मानसिक योग्यता, मात्रात्मक अभिरुचि एवं बोधगम्यता', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'Percentages, Successive Change & Base Effects', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Economy', 'General Studies', 'Quantitative Aptitude', 'Mental Ability']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 104–106: Use the following table. Earnings and profits are in ₹ thousand crore; entries are in company order X, Y, Z, W.

