    ('epfo-eoao-apfc-2025-q10', 10, 2025, 'November', 1, 'eoao-apfc', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO & APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.reading_comprehension_sentence_correction_verbal_ability.verbal_ability_sentence_rearrangement', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Reading Comprehension, Sentence Correction & Verbal Ability', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'Verbal Ability & Sentence Rearrangement (Para Jumbles / Sentence Reordering - Identifying Opening Sentences, Connecting Links, Pronoun References, Concluding Sentences; Cloze Test - Contextual Word Fillers; Sentence Completion & Double Fillers)', 'medium', ARRAY['General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 6–10: Fill the blank with the most appropriate option.', 'Directions for questions 6–10: Fill the blank with the most appropriate option.', 'They _____ be very far away. I saw them a little while ago.', 'They _____ be very far away. I saw them a little while ago.', 'shall not', 'cannot', 'should not', 'ought not', 'shall not', 'cannot', 'should not', 'ought not', 'b', 'Correct Answer: (b) cannot

