    ('epfo-eoao-apfc-2025-q13', 13, 2025, 'November', 1, 'eoao-apfc', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO & APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'language_proficiency_grammar_communication.english_vocabulary_idioms_phrasal_verbs.lexical_building_blocks', 'Language Proficiency, Grammar & Communication (general Kannada & General English)', 'भाषा प्रवीणता, व्याकरण एवं संचार', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'English Vocabulary, Idioms & Phrasal Verbs', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'Lexical Building Blocks (Root Words: Greek & Latin roots; Prefixes & Suffixes; Synonyms & Antonyms; Homonyms, Homophones & Commonly Confused Words; One-Word Substitutions)', 'medium', ARRAY['General English', 'Language', 'Language Proficiency']::TEXT[], 'Directions for questions 11–15: Choose the option closest in meaning to the emphasized word.', 'Directions for questions 11–15: Choose the option closest in meaning to the emphasized word.', 'His ad hominem comments were EGREGIOUS.', 'His ad hominem comments were EGREGIOUS.', 'extensively elaborate', 'flagrant and shocking', 'out of context', 'impromptu and unintended', 'extensively elaborate', 'flagrant and shocking', 'out of context', 'impromptu and unintended', 'b', 'Correct Answer: (b) flagrant and shocking

