    ('epfo-eoao-apfc-2025-q107', 107, 2025, 'November', 1, 'eoao-apfc', 'UPSC EPFO EO/AO & APFC', 'upsc-epfo', 'insurance.principles_and_fundamentals_of_insurance.fundamental_legal_principles_of_insurance', 'Insurance', 'बीमा', 'Principles & Fundamentals of Insurance', 'Principles & Fundamentals of Insurance', 'Fundamental Legal Principles of Insurance', 'Fundamental Legal Principles of Insurance', 'medium', ARRAY['Indian Polity', 'Constitution', 'General Studies', 'Insurance Principles', 'Insurable Interest', 'Indemnity & Subrogation']::TEXT[], NULL, NULL, 'Which is not a contract of indemnity?', 'कौन क्षतिपूर्ति संविदा नहीं?', 'Fire insurance', 'Life insurance', 'Marine insurance', 'Motor insurance', 'अग्नि बीमा', 'जीवन बीमा', 'समुद्री बीमा', 'मोटर बीमा', 'b', 'Correct Answer: (b) Life insurance

